# Hologram Summary

The HoloJARVIS holographic display system combines a 2.4-inch TFT LCD, a 100 mm convex magnifying lens, a 100 mm watch glass, and a 45° reflective glass inside a custom enclosure to produce a floating AI avatar. By combining transparent rendering, magnification, and optical reflection, the system creates a compact desktop holographic interface suitable for voice interaction, AI visualization, and future upgrades without relying on expensive volumetric holographic hardware.
